 color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">메이스</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/upolearms/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">풀암</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><br></span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uscepters/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">셉터</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uspears/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스피어</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/ustaves/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스태프</span></b></font><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">| </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uswords/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스워드</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">던지는 \n                무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> |</span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">완드</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Elite \nUniques</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">: </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/left_menu/alpha_background_2.gif\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020830042522/http://forg.uospace.net:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Exceptional Unique Scepters \n                             \n                            </span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[익셉셔널 유니크 셉터]</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/scepter.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"118\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:62/118\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Knell \nStriker</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Scepter</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">One-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(11.9-12.6) To (20.4-21.6)</font> (16.15-17.1 Avg)<br>Required \nLevel: 5<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Durability: 50<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% Enhanced Damage</font> (varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% Damage To Undead</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25% Chance Of \nCrushing Blow</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+35 To Attack \nRating</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Poison Resist +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+15 To \nMana</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">한손 \n                            데미지: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(11.9-12.6) To (20.4-21.6)</font> (16.15-17.1 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : 5<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>내구력 : 50<br>무기기본속도 \n                            : \n[0]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+70-80% 증가된 데미지  </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">150% 언데드계열에대한 데미지</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25% 기회로 강한 타격</font>*<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+35 공격등급</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">포이즌 저항력  +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 저항력 +20%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+15 마나</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://forg.uospace.net:80/Diablo/images/item/unique/grandscepter.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"118\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:62/118\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Rusthandle</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Grand Scepter</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">One-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(16.5-17.4) To (35.5-37.4)</font> (26-27.4 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n18<br>Required Strength: 37<br>Durability: 60<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+50-60% Enhanced Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 3-7 damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+100-110% Damage To \nUndead</font> (varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">8% Life stolen per \nhit</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To Paladin Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Magic damage reduced by 1</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To \nThorns (Paladin Only)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1-3 To Vengeance (Paladin \nOnly)</font> (varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0